  "content": "\n\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:12px\">本模组为 Macaw 的桥梁/栅栏/屋顶/家具/楼梯以及 Abnormals Team 开发的模组提供多重兼容支持。</span></h1>\n<p>该模组将自动使用其他模组的材料添加桥梁、屋顶或栅栏。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em>我已经安装了 Macaw's Bridges - Abnormals，我担心安装此模组后会删除我已放置的所有桥梁。</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>不用担心，本模组会将旧版兼容内容中的所有旧方块和物品进行转换。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本模组是 Macaw 模组的非官方附加组件。若模组出现崩溃或错误，请在此&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Samlegamer/Macaw-s-Addons/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Issue</a> 中反馈。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>本模组支持以下模组：&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- Macaw 的桥梁</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1077/904/2025-01-25_22.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- Macaw 的屋顶</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1077/905/2025-01-25_22.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- Macaw 的栅栏</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1077/907/2025-01-25_22.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- Macaw 的家具</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1077/909/2025-01-25_22.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><br>- Macaw 的楼梯</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1077/915/2025-01-25_22.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><em>1.1 更新日志</em></strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1102/857/2025-02-20_11.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><br>必需依赖项：</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/addonslib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>AddonsLib</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blueprint\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Blueprint</strong></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">可选依赖项：</span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sketch_macaw/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw 的模组</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>支持 Abnormals Team 模组：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>- <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/buzzier-bees\" rel=\"nofollow\">Buzzier Bees</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>- <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/environmental\" rel=\"nofollow\">Environmental</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>- <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgrade-aquatic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Upgrade Aquatic</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>- <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/autumnity\" rel=\"nofollow\">Autumnity</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/endergetic\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Endergetic Expansion</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/atmospheric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Atmospheric</a></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/caverns-and-chasms\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caverns &amp; Chasms</a></strong></span></p>",
